N&gt;&amp;sig=&lt;HMAC&gt;</span></span></code></pre>\n</div><p class=\"text-pretty\">When tapped, a lightweight API Gateway HTTP endpoint validates the signature and calls <code>sfnClient.sendTaskSuccess()</code>:</p><div class=\"code-block relative my-5 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm group\">\n<div class=\"code-block-header flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-mono\">\n<span class=\"font-medium\">typescript</span>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code-btn inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded transition-colors\" data-code=\"%2F%2F%20lambdas%2Fapproval-callback%2Fhandler.ts%0Aimport%20%7B%20SFNClient%2C%20SendTaskSuccessCommand%2C%20SendTaskFailureCommand%20%7D%20from%20%22%40aws-sdk%2Fclient-sfn%22%3B%0Aimport%20%7B%20verifyHmacSignature%20%7D%20from%20%22..%2Futils%2Fcrypto%22%3B%0A%0Aconst%20sfn%20%3D%20new%20SFNClient(%7B%7D)%3B%0A%0Aexport%20async%20function%20handler(event%3A%20APIGatewayProxyEventV2)%20%7B%0A%20%20const%20%7B%20action%2C%20token%2C%20sig%20%7D%20%3D%20event.queryStringParameters%20%7C%7C%20%7B%7D%3B%0A%0A%20%20if%20(!verifyHmacSignature(token%2C%20sig))%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20return%20%7B%20statusCode%3A%20403%2C%20body%3A%20JSON.stringify(%7B%20error%3A%20%22Invalid%20cryptographic%20signature%22%20%7D)%20%7D%3B%0A%20%20%7D%0A%0A%20%20if%20(action%20%3D%3D%3D%20%22approve%22)%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20await%20sfn.send(new%20SendTaskSuccessCommand(%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20taskToken%3A%20token%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20output%3A%20JSON.stringify(%7B%20status%3A%20%22APPROVED%22%2C%20approvedAt%3A%20new%20Date().toISOString()%20%7D)%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%7D))%3B%0A%20%20%20%20return%20%7B%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20statusCode%3A%20200%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20headers%3A%20%7B%20%22Content-Type%22%3A%20%22text%2Fhtml%22%20%7D%2C%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20body%3A%20%22%3Ch1%3EDraft%20Approved!%3C%2Fh1%3E%3Cp%3EPostHub%20is%20now%20broadcasting%20your%20content%20across%20platfo