--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    audience: process.env.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  return</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    sub: payload.sub,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    email: payload.email </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">as</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> string</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    authorized: payload.email </span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">===</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> process.env.</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">ADMIN_EMAIL</span><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  };</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"--shiki-light:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre>\n</div><hr /><h2 id=\"real-time-synchronization-via-dynamodb-streams-websockets\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>Real-Time Synchronization via DynamoDB Streams &amp; WebSockets</span><a href=\"#real-time-synchronization-via-dynamodb-streams-websockets\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h2><p class=\"text-pretty\">When multiple platforms publish concurrently, administrative dashboards must display real-time status badges (<code>Queued</code>, <code>Processing</code>, <code>Live</code>, or <code>Failed</code>) without repetitive polling:</p><ol>\n<li><strong>DynamoDB Record Mutation</strong>: As each platform worker finishes, it writes its result directly to the unified table:<br /><code>PK: POST#&lt;id&gt;</code>, <code>SK: PLATFORM#LINKEDIN</code>, <code>Status: LIVE</code>, <code>ExternalUrl: \"https://...\"</code>.</li>\n<li><strong>DynamoDB Streams &amp; Event Filtering</strong>: The stream triggers a lightweight router Lambda only on mutations where <code>Status</code> changes.</li>\n<li><strong>API Gateway WebSocket Dispatcher</strong>: The router maps active client connection IDs from a Redis/DynamoDB registry and pushes targeted JSON frames down open WebSocket channels in under 35ms.</li>\n</ol><div class=\"code-block relative my-5 rounded-xl overflow-hidden border border-slate-200 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm group\">\n<div class=\"code-block-header flex items-center justify-between px-4 py-1.5 text-xs font-mono\">\n<span class=\"font-medium\">text</span>\n<button type=\"button\" class=\"copy-code-btn inline-flex items-center gap-1.5 text-xs px-2 py-0.5 rounded transition-colors\" data-code=\"%5BPlatform%20Worker%20Completes%5D%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%94%82%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%96%BC%0A%5BDynamoDB%20PutItem%20(Status%3A%20LIVE)%5D%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%94%82%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%96%BC%20(DynamoDB%20Stream%20Event)%0A%5BStream%20Router%20Lambda%5D%20%E2%94%80%E2%94%80%E2%96%BA%20Query%20Active%20Connections%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%94%82%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%96%BC%0A%5BAPI%20Gateway%20WebSocket%20Management%20API%5D%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%94%82%0A%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%E2%96%BC%0A%5BPostHub%20Web%20Console%3A%20Green%20Checkmark%20Badge%20Lights%20Up%5D\" data-i18n-aria=\"copyCode\" aria-label=\"Copy code\"><svg width=\"12\" height=\"12\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><rect width=\"14\" height=\"14\" x=\"8\" y=\"8\" rx=\"2\" ry=\"2\"></rect><path d=\"M4 16c-1.1 0-2-.9-2-2V4c0-1.1.9-2 2-2h10c1.1 0 2 .9 2 2\"></path></svg><span data-copy-label>Copy</span></button>\n</div>\n<pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark shiki-pre\" style=\"--shiki-light:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8;--shiki-light-bg:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>[Platform Worker Completes]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>           │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>           ▼</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[DynamoDB PutItem (Status: LIVE)]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>           │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>           ▼ (DynamoDB Stream Event)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[Stream Router Lambda] ──► Query Active Connections</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>           │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>           ▼</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[API Gateway WebSocket Management API]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>           │</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>           ▼</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>[PostHub Web Console: Green Checkmark Badge Lights Up]</span></span></code></pre>\n</div><hr /><h2 id=\"results-operational-efficiency\" class=\"group flex items-center gap-2 text-balance scroll-mt-24\"><span>Results &amp; Operational Efficiency</span><a href=\"#results-operational-efficiency\" class=\"heading-anchor text-gray-400 opacity-0 group-hover:opacity-100 focus-visible:opacity-100 transition-opacity text-sm no-underline\" data-i18n-aria=\"linkToSection\" aria-label=\"Link to section\">#</a></h2><p class=\"text-pretty\">PostHub's serverless orchestration architecture provides:</p><ul>\n<li><strong>Zero Idle Costs</strong>: During quiet periods, computing expenses are precisely $0.00.</li>\n<li><strong>Resilient Multi-Platform Fault Isolation</strong>: If an individual social network experiences an outage or temporary HTTP 500 error, Step Functions automatically retries that branch without re-publishing duplicate posts to other networks.</li>\n<li><strong>Deterministic Peace of Mind</strong>: The 1-click cryptographic task token ensures zero unauthorized posts can ever go live without explicit human review.</li>\n</ul><p class=\"text-pretty\">Through PostHub (live on <a href=\"https://aldeon.app/postshub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"font-medium text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:underline\">Web</a>, <a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/us/app/postshub/id6813979346\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"font-medium text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:underline\">Apple App Store</a>, and <a href=\"https://play.google.com/apps/testing/com.aldeon.posthub\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"font-medium text-emerald-600 dark:text-emerald-400 hover:underline\">Google Play Closed Beta</a>), technical content authored across the Aldeon platform reaches its global audience systematically and reliably—including ProseMirror AST formatting and OTP step-up verification for Substack publishing.</p>"}
